= test sequence_numbers_do_not_wrap
= unused session tickets and PSKs: none are ever issued (PLAN section 5), so there is nothing to keep or to discard
> All the alerts listed in Section 6.2 MUST be sent with AlertLevel=fatal and MUST be treated as error alerts when received regardless of the AlertLevel in the message.
= code encode every alert other than close_notify with level fatal(2)
