@ 7.1
> Once all the values which are to be derived from a given secret have been computed, that secret SHOULD be erased.
= code overwrite each secret (the ECDHE output, the early, handshake and master secrets, superseded traffic secrets) as soon as everything derived from it has been computed
= test bug_master_secret_outlived_its_use
= test bug_handshake_secrets_were_never_wiped
