= test both_sites_and_both_key_forms
> Servers requiring this extension SHOULD respond to a ClientHello lacking a "server_name" extension by terminating the connection with a "missing_extension" alert.
= code refuse a ClientHello without server_name with missing_extension; unrecognized_name is only for a name we have no certificate for (PLAN section 5)
